  <ferc:CompanyIdentifier id="f-1" contextRef="c-1">C000582</ferc:CompanyIdentifier>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantFinancialChangesTextBlock id="f-2" contextRef="c-1" xsi:nil="true"></ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantFinancialChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-3" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Basis of Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;These financial statements have been prepared in accordance with the accounting requirements of the FERC. We have condensed or omitted certain information or notes pursuant to FERC rules and regulations. Therefore, these financial statements should be read in conjunction with our Annual Report on FERC Form No. 2 for the year ended December 31, 2025, which includes a summary of significant accounting policies and other disclosures. We have made normal and recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of the financial results for the interim period presented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSubsequentEventsTextBlock id="f-4" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Subsequent Events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Subsequent events are events or transactions that occur after the financial statement date but before the financial statements are issued or are available to be issued. The Company has evaluated subsequent events through August&#160;28, 2026, as this was the date financial statements were made available to be issued. There were no subsequent events identified requiring adjustment to or disclosure in these financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSubsequentEventsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInAndImportantAdditionsToFranchiseRightsTextBlock id="f-5" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;1. Not Applicable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInAndImportantAdditionsToFranchiseRightsTextBlock>
