          <tr>
            <td colspan="9" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(Note 1) Current Tax Payable (Receivable) included in Retained Earnings - We are included in the consolidated tax return of DT Midstream, Inc., our indirect parent company. However, the FERC establishes the method of accounting for income taxes. In our balance sheet, our income tax liabilities have been calculated as if we were filing a separate return. Current tax payable (receivable) is relieved through retained earnings.</span>
